CHAPTER 2: CHARACTERISTICS OF THE POPULATION
2.1 Socio-cultural characteristics of the population
2.1.1 Nationality of the population of Ngororero district
The results of 5 th RPHC-2022 indicate that, the Rwandan population by nationality represent 99.1% and
foreigners represent 0.9%. In the Western Province, foreigners represent 0.5% and Ngororero districts, the
Rwandan by nationality represent 99.98% and foreigners represent 0.02% (72).  three sectors of Ngororero
districts that have the highest percentage of foreigners compared to others; those are Kabaya (14 foreigners),
Gatumba, and Muhanda (11 foreigners ea ch). The Table 2.   1  below illustrates the distribution of the
population by nationality with their respective sectors of residence.
